; npm 11/12 gate URL-tarball dependencies (EALLOWREMOTE). The house pins its own
; packages as GitHub release tarballs (@pacsarcade/puck-config, arcade-ui …).
; `root` (the tighter setting) passed locally on npm 12 but FAILED a cold
; `npm install` on Vercel (Node 24 / npm 11, 0018.06.17 a₿: "Fetching non-root
; packages of type remote have been disabled") — every push only built because
; the build cache was restored. `all` is npm's own default; the lockfile still
; pins every URL, so nothing unpinned can enter.
allow-remote=all
